let __v_303 = Value::from("Mostly nothing to fix: a child grinding brand-new teeth is common, harmless and passes as the bite settles, and sore gums make a teething baby grind. It does not damage the teeth, and no guard goes on a child whose teeth are still coming through. If it carries on for months, or comes with a sore jaw, mention it at the next dental check.");
