let __v_483 = Value::from("Never double up to catch up: skip the missed dose and take the next one at its usual time. Check the leaflet or ask a pharmacist first, because a few medicines (insulin, blood thinners, epilepsy tablets, the contraceptive pill) are exceptions where an extra dose is the right thing.");
