let __v_934 = Value::from("Tea is not one of the usual ones - coffee, alcohol, mint and fizzy drinks are the drinks that matter most - but tea has caffeine in it too, so a strong cup can loosen the valve the same way coffee does. If tea is the one thing you always have before it starts, a fortnight without it will tell you. An antacid or an alginate (Gaviscon and the like) settles a bad night in minutes.");
